A web server for nex
====================

kinex allows you to have your nex station available over the web.

Usage
-----

kinex [-s style.css] [-t template.tpl] [-p 8080] /var/nex/ nex.nightfall.city

Installation
------------

To install on OpenBSD as a daemon:

First, create an unprivileged user:
useradd -c"kinexd Daemon" -d/var/empty -s/sbin/nologin _kinexd

Then create the /var/nex, from which the files will be served

Finally run the following:
1. `make build`
2. copy binary to /usr/local/bin/, make sure it's executable
3. create /etc/rc.d/kinexd with the following content

```
#!/bin/ksh

daemon="/usr/local/bin/kinex /var/nex"
daemon_user="_kinexd"

. /etc/rc.d/rc.subr

rc_bg=YES
rc_reload=NO

rc_cmd $1
```

Now you can start the server by running `rcctl start kinexd`.
